<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - July 17.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - July 17.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in Russia's North Caucasus and Rostov-on-Don in Southern Russia may be closed for short periods on July 17 due to heavy thunderstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Flights also may be postponed at airports in Eastern Ukraine due to heavy thunderstorms, the service said.</p>
<p>The probability of closure was 75 percent, it said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
